<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> seems surprised by your response, stumbling to find the English words to respond. But you just pat him on the head, telling him to save his breath, and walk away. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> turns to you as you leave, but accepts your rejection and walks away sadly. With that taken care of, it was time to start the first day of your new life.<br>
